          "node_kind": "theorem",
          "risk_level": "R3",
          "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14",
          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a connected scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be a geometric point\nof <MATH_0003>.\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> The fibre functor <MATH_0004> defines an equivalence of\ncategories\n<MATH_0005>\n<STRUCT_0004> Given a second geometric point <MATH_0006> of <MATH_0007> there\nexists an isomorphism <MATH_0008>.\nThis gives an isomorphism <MATH_0009>\ncompatible with the equivalences in (1). This isomorphism is\nindependent of <MATH_0010> up to inner conjugation.\n<STRUCT_0005> Given a morphism <MATH_0011> of connected schemes denote\n<MATH_0012>. There is a canonical\ncontinuous homomorphism\n<MATH_0013>\nsuch that the diagram\n<MATH_0014>\nis commutative.\n<STRUCT_0006>\n<STRUCT_0007>",
          "source_status": "CURRENT",
          "placeholders": {
            "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{theorem}",
            "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{theorem-fundamental-group}",
            "MATH_0001": "$X$",
            "MATH_0002": "$\\overline{x}$",
            "MATH_0003": "$X$",
            "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}",
            "STRUCT_0003": "\\item",
            "MATH_0004": "$F_{\\overline{x}}$",
            "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\textit{F\\'Et}_X \\longrightarrow\n\\textit{Finite-}\\pi_1(X, \\overline{x})\\textit{-Sets}\n$$",
            "STRUCT_0004": "\\item",
            "MATH_0006": "$\\overline{x}'$",
            "MATH_0007": "$X$",
            "MATH_0008": "$t : F_{\\overline{x}} \\to F_{\\overline{x}'}$",
            "MATH_0009": "$\\pi_1(X, \\overline{x}) \\to \\pi_1(X, \\overline{x}')$",
            "MATH_0010": "$t$",
            "STRUCT_0005": "\\item",
            "MATH_0011": "$f : X \\to Y$",
            "MATH_0012": "$\\overline{y} = f \\circ \\overline{x}$",
            "MATH_0013": "$$\nf_* : \\pi_1(X, \\overline{x}) \\to \\pi_1(Y, \\overline{y})\n$$",
            "MATH_0014": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\textit{F\\'Et}_Y \\ar[r]_{\\text{base change}} \\ar[d]_{F_{\\overline{y}}} &\n\\textit{F\\'Et}_X \\ar[d]^{F_{\\overline{x}}} \\\\\n\\textit{Finite-}\\pi_1(Y, \\overline{y})\\textit{-Sets} \\ar[r]^{f_*} &\n\\textit{Finite-}\\pi_1(X, \\overline{x})\\textit{-Sets}\n}\n$$",
            "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}",
            "STRUCT_0007": "\\end{theorem}"
          },
